              <span class="text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800 font-mono">1,420+ Citations</span>
            </div>
            <h4 class="font-extrabold text-court-navy text-base">Managing Director, ECIL v. B. Karunakar</h4>
            <p class="text-slate-600 font-mono text-xs font-semibold">(1993) 4 SCC 727 • Constitution Bench (5 Judges)</p>
            <p class="text-slate-800 text-xs leading-relaxed font-medium">
              Established that non-supply of an inquiry report causes prejudice and violates natural justice under Article 311(2).
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-rose-50/80 border-2 border-rose-300 space-y-2.5 shadow-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-rose-600 text-white">
                🔴 OVERRULED PRECEDENT WARNING
              </span>
              <span class="text-xs font-bold text-rose-800 font-mono">Invalidated</span>
            </div>
            <h4 class="font-extrabold text-court-navy text-base">Krishna Janardhan Bhat v. Dattatraya Hegde</h4>
            <p class="text-slate-600 font-mono text-xs font-semibold">(2008) 4 SCC 54 • 2-Judge Bench</p>
            <p class="text-rose-900 text-xs leading-relaxed font-semibold">
              EXPRESSLY OVERRULED by 3-Judge Bench in Rangappa v. Sri Mohan (2010) 11 SCC 441. System automatically blocks reliance.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/80 border-2 border-amber-300 space-y-2.5 shadow-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-amber-600 text-white">
                🔴 CONSTITUTIONAL OVERRULING
              </span>
              <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-900 font-mono">Historical Reversal</span>
            </div>
            <h4 class="font-extrabold text-court-navy text-base">ADM Jabalpur v. Shivkant Shukla</h4>
            <p class="text-slate-600 font-mono text-xs font-semibold">(1976) 2 SCC 521 • Emergency Habeas Corpus</p>
            <p class="text-amber-950 text-xs leading-relaxed font-semibold">
              OVERRULED by 9-Judge Constitution Bench in Justice K.S. Puttaswamy (2017) 10 SCC 1. Unanimously recognized as bad law.
